{"ex-405-1":{"id":"ex-405-1","chapter":"405","number":1,"title":"磁場的方向","question":"<p>(a) 電流通過一條長直導線，方向指入頁面（圖 a）。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的磁場方向。</p><p>(b) 電流通過一條長直導線，方向指向上（圖 b）。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的磁場方向。</p><p>(c) 如圖 c 所示，電流通過螺線管（圖 c）。</p><p>(i) 求螺線管內的磁場方向。</p><p>(ii) 螺線管的哪一端是南極？</p><p>X 電流電流</p><p>圖 a 圖 b 圖 c</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/4a32df6534e99863963049cd.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:486.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 向上</p><p>(b) 指入頁面</p><p>(c) (i) 向右</p><p>(ii) 左端</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/23bbe26299f2f8ef43e7eb29.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:179.4px\"></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/44cdc2df665c8a1bedd48ca5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:179.4px\"></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/e096822e763aea2427f7152d.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:182.5px\"></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":14,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,334.8380584716797],"text":"例 題 1 磁場的方向\r\n(a) 電流通過一條長直導線，方向指入頁面（圖 a）。求 X 點的磁場方\r\n向。\r\n(b) 電流通過一條長直導線，方向指向上（圖 b）。求 Y 點的磁場方向。\r\n(c) 如圖 c 所示，電流通過螺線管（圖 c）。\r\n (i) 求螺線管內的磁場方向。\r\n (ii) 螺線管的哪一端是南極？\r\nX\r\n電流\r\n圖 a\r\nY\r\n電流\r\n圖 b 圖 c\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,334.8380584716797,560.2833009033203,461.3749833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 向上\r\n(b) 指入頁面\r\n(c) (i) 向右\r\n (ii) 左端\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,179.2833009033203,461.3749833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n(a)\r\nX\r\n磁力線\r\n(b)\r\n磁力線 電流 Y\r\n(c)\r\nS N\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-2":{"id":"ex-405-2","chapter":"405","number":2,"title":"合磁場的方向","question":"<p>兩條平行的長直導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 都有電流通過，電流的方向相反。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點合磁場的方向。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/eef957d29057eaa08e3096ca.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:223.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 產生的磁場都指向上方。</p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的合磁場指向上方。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":14,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,525.5269833984376,560.2833009033203,660.5820617675781],"text":"例 題 2 合磁場的方向\r\n兩條平行的長直導線 X 和 Y 都有電流通過，電流的方向相反。求 P\r\n點合磁場的方向。\r\nX P Y\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,660.5820617675781,560.2833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n在 P 點，X 和 Y 產生的磁場都指向上方。\r\n∴ P 點的合磁場指向上方。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-3":{"id":"ex-405-3","chapter":"405","number":3,"title":"電磁鐵","question":"<p>學生把螺線管連接到電池，以製作電磁鐵（圖 a）。</p><p>圖 a 圖 b</p><p>(a) 學生降低可變電阻的電阻值，電磁鐵的強度會怎樣改變？</p><p>(b) 舉出電磁鐵相對於永久磁鐵的一個優勝之處。</p><p>(c) 軟鐵心和鋼心都可以提升電磁鐵強度。不過，開關斷開後，鋼心仍保留磁性（即表現得像磁鐵），軟鐵心則沒有。哪個核心較適合用來做電磁鐵？為甚麼？</p><p>(d) 學生把另一個螺線管串聯到原來的螺線管上（圖 b）。兩個螺線管是相同的，它們的電阻可略去不計。電磁鐵的強度會怎樣改變？</p><p>試解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5f0b42e38a5046c66c1dd141.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:366.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 電阻減小時，通過螺線管的電流增加，因此，電磁鐵的強度會提升。</p><p>(b) 電磁鐵的磁性可以關掉。 / 電磁鐵的強度可以改變。</p><p>(c) 軟鐵心較合適。如果使用鋼心，便不能消除電磁鐵的磁性。</p><p>(d) 強度保持不變，因為螺線管每單位長度的匝數保持不變。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,247.6689833984375,565.2833009033203,591.2761688232422],"text":"例 題 3 電磁鐵\r\n學生把螺線管連接到電池，以製作電磁鐵（圖 a）。\r\n圖 a\r\nI\r\n圖 b\r\nI\r\n(a) 學生降低可變電阻的電阻值，電磁鐵的強度會怎樣改變？\r\n(b) 舉出電磁鐵相對於永久磁鐵的一個優勝之處。\r\n(c) 軟鐵心和鋼心都可以提升電磁鐵強度。不過，開關斷開後，鋼心\r\n仍保留磁性（即表現得像磁鐵），軟鐵心則沒有。哪個核心較適合\r\n用來做電磁鐵？為甚麼？\r\n(d) 學生把另一個螺線管串聯到原來的螺線管上（圖 b）。兩個螺線管\r\n是相同的，它們的電阻可略去不計。電磁鐵的強度會怎樣改變？\r\n試解釋。\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,591.2761688232422,565.2833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 電阻減小時，通過螺線管的電流增加，因此，電磁鐵的強度會\r\n提升。\r\n(b) 電磁鐵的磁性可以關掉。 / 電磁鐵的強度可以改變。\r\n(c) 軟鐵心較合適。如果使用鋼心，便不能消除電磁鐵的磁性。\r\n(d) 強度保持不變，因為螺線管每單位長度的匝數保持不變。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-4":{"id":"ex-405-4","chapter":"405","number":4,"title":"電鈴","question":"<p>電鈴（圖 a）利用電磁鐵運作。圖 b 顯示電鈴的示意圖。解釋其運作原理。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/7700984052b5a98d7eace606.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:526.6px\"></p>","answer":"<p>按下電鈴按鈕時，電路閉合。鈴錘上的鐵片受電磁鐵吸引，於是鈴錘擊響鈴碗。這時候電路會斷開（圖 c），電磁鐵因而失去磁性。鈴錘彈回原位，又再次回到接觸斷路器，電路因而再次閉合。只要一直按着電鈴按鈕，整個過程便不斷重複。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/b131af236c8e7be57dd9228d.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:209.6px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,287.4189833984375,565.2833009033203,550.8069610595703],"text":"例 題 4 電鈴\r\n電鈴（圖 a）以電磁鐵操作。圖 b 簡略顯示電鈴的構造。試解釋它怎\r\n樣運作。\r\n鈴碗\r\n電磁鐵\r\n電鈴按鈕\r\n鈴錘\r\n接觸斷路器\r\n彈簧\r\n鐵片\r\n圖 a 圖 b\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,550.8069610595703,565.2833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n按下電鈴按鈕時，電路閉合。鈴錘上\r\n的鐵片受電磁鐵吸引，於是鈴錘擊響\r\n鈴碗。這時候電路會斷開（圖 c），電\r\n磁鐵因而失去磁性。鈴錘彈回原位，\r\n又再次回到接觸斷路器，電路因而再\r\n次閉合。只要一直按着電鈴按鈕，整\r\n個過程便不斷重複。 電路斷開\r\n圖 c\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","question"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-5":{"id":"ex-405-5","chapter":"405","number":5,"title":"與導線的距離","question":"<p>0.5 A 的電流通過一條長直導線。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點與導線的距離是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span>，在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點磁場的強度是 4 μT。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span>。取 μ<sub>0</sub> = 4π × 10<sup>–7</sup> T m A<sup>–1</sup>。</p>","answer":"<p>By <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>B</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>μ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>,</p><p>4 × 10<sup>–6</sup> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 0.025 m</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":21,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,148.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 5 與導線的距離\r\n0.5 A 的電流通過一條長直導線。P 點與導線的距離是 d，在 P 點磁\r\n場的強度是 4 μT。求 d。取 μ 0 = 4π × 10–7 T m A–1。\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,148.6500701904297,565.2833009033203,278.1869833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n根據 B = μ 0I\r\n2πr\r\n，\r\n4 × 10–6 = (4π × 10–7) × (0.5)\r\n2π(d)\r\nd = 0.025 m\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-6":{"id":"ex-405-6","chapter":"405","number":6,"title":"兩條導線之間的中和點","question":"<p>兩條平行長直導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 分別載有 2 A 和 3 A 電流。兩者相距6 cm。</p><p>6 cm 2 A 3 A X Y</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點是導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 之間的一個中和點。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點與導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/4be614614404f0f015eae9b6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:228.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點，導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 產生的磁場 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span>) 指向下，而導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 產生的磁場 (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span>) 指向上。它們互相抵消。</p><p>因此，根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}I}{2πr}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.06</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}(2)}{2π(0.06 - d)}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}(3)}{2π(d)}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>2<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 3(0.06 – <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span>)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.036 m</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/1d1ada6095a7d6092e330998.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:177.1px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"<p>如果 X 中的電流增加，中和點的位置會如何改變？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>中和點移向電流不變的導線 Y。若兩導線相距 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>D</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 從 Y 量起，由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>D</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> 得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>D</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>X</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> 增加會令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 減小。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":21,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,293.1869833984374,565.2833009033203,451.16395568847656],"text":"例 題 6 兩條導線之間的中和點\r\n兩條平行長直導線 X 和 Y 分別載有 2 A 和 3 A 電 流。兩 者 相 距\r\n6 cm。\r\n2 A 3 A\r\nX Y\r\n6 cm\r\nQ 點是導線 X 和 Y 之間的一個中和點。求 Q 點與導線 Y 的距離 d。\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,451.16395568847656,565.2833009033203,690.9069833984374],"text":"題 解\r\n在 Q 點，導線 X 產生的磁場 (BX) 指向下，\r\n而導線 Y 產生的磁場 (BY) 指向上。它們互相\r\n抵消。\r\n因此，根據 B = μ 0I\r\n2πr\r\n，\r\nBX = BY\r\nμ 0(2)\r\n2π(0.06 – d)\r\n = μ 0(3)\r\n2π(d)\r\n 2d = 3(0.06 – d)\r\nd = 0.036 m\r\nX Y Q\r\nBY\r\n(0.06 – d) d\r\nBx\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-7":{"id":"ex-405-7","chapter":"405","number":7,"title":"計算合磁場","question":"<p>兩條長直導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 互相垂直。如圖所示，它們分別載有 5 A 和 6 A 的電流。取 μ<sub>0</sub> = 4π × 10<sup>–7</sup> T m A<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的合磁場。</p><p>(b) 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點所得的磁場量度值小於 (a) 所得的答案。試舉出一個原因。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/49548e6fd528b0ae2d58fc6e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:158.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點產生的磁場 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}I}{2πr}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.04</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(4π \\times  10^{-7})(5)}{2π(0.04)}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.5 × 10<sup>–5</sup> T（ 指出頁面）</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點產生的磁場 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}I}{2πr}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.03</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(4π \\times  10^{-7})(6)}{2π(0.03)}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4 × 10<sup>–5</sup> T（ 指入頁面）</p><p>∴ 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的合磁場 = 4 × 10<sup>–5</sup> – 2.5 × 10<sup>–5</sup> = 1.5 × 10<sup>–5</sup> T（ 指入頁面）</p><p>(b) 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點，地球磁場指出頁面。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":22,"kind":"question","box":[49.83430090332031,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,204.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 7 計算合磁場\r\n兩條長直導線 X 和 Y 互相垂直。如圖所示，它們分別載有 5 A 和 6 A 的\r\n電流。取 μ 0 = 4π × 10–7 T m A–1。\r\n(a) 求 P 點的合磁場。\r\n(b) 在 P 點所得的磁場量度值小於 (a) 所得的答案。試舉出一個原因。\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"answer","box":[49.83430090332031,204.6500701904297,560.2833009033203,371.6869833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) X 在 P 點產生的磁場 = μ 0I\r\n2πr = (4π × 10–7)(5)\r\n2π(0.04)\r\n= 2.5 × 10–5 T （指出頁面）\r\nY 在 P 點產生的磁場 = μ 0I\r\n2πr = (4π × 10–7)(6)\r\n2π(0.03)\r\n= 4 × 10–5 T （指入頁面）\r\n∴ 在 P 點的合磁場 = 4 × 10–5 – 2.5 × 10–5 = 1.5 × 10–5 T （指入頁面）\r\n(b) 在 P 點，地球磁場指出頁面。\r\nY\r\nX\r\nP 3 cm\r\n6 A 4 cm\r\n5 A\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-8":{"id":"ex-405-8","chapter":"405","number":8,"title":"估算真空磁導率","question":"<p>志文如圖 a 所示連接長直導線。他把安裝了磁場檢測器應用程式的手機放在距離電線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的位置，並量度垂直於頁面的磁場 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>⊥</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{⊥}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。然後他改變 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>，再量度相應的<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>⊥</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{⊥}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 值。圖 b 顯示所得的結果。安培計的讀數是 5 A。</p><p>圖 b</p><p>(a) 為甚麼線圖不穿過原點？</p><p>(b) 從線圖估算 μ<sub>0</sub> 的值。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/55a8a6647aed2ad940942587.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:218.5px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/f1cb53679d6dc35951e000df.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:337.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 因為地球磁場 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 會計算入 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>⊥</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{⊥}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的值。</p><p>(b) 電流產生的磁場 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}I}{2πr}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>⊥</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{⊥}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> μ</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{_{0}I}{2π}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>μ ∴ 線圖的斜率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{_{0}I}{2π}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(80 - 36) \\times  10^{-6}}{50 - 0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}(5)}{2π}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>μ<sub>0</sub> = 1.11 × 10<sup>–6</sup> T m A<sup>–1</sup> 複習5 Q4 (p.213)</p><p>溫習 5 第 4 題（第 213 頁）</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":23,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,497.7434539794922],"text":"例 題 8 估算真空磁導率\r\n志文如圖 a 所示連接長直導線。他把安\r\n裝了磁場檢測器應用程式的手機放在距\r\n離電線 r 的位置，並量度垂直於頁面的\r\n磁場 B⊥。然後他改變 r，再量度相應的\r\nB⊥ 值。圖 b 顯示所得的結果。安培計\r\n的讀數是 5 A。\r\nB⊥ / μT\r\n1\r\n– / m–1 \r\n10 r 0\r\n20\r\n40\r\n60\r\n80\r\n20 30 40 50\r\n圖 b\r\n(a) 為甚麼線圖不穿過原點？\r\n(b) 從線圖估算 μ 0 的值。\r\n"},{"page":23,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,497.7434539794922,565.2833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 因為地球磁場 BE 會計算入 B⊥ 的值。\r\n(b) 電流產生的磁場 BC = μ 0I\r\n2πr\r\nB⊥ = BC + BE\r\n = μ 0I\r\n2π\r\n×\r\n1\r\nr\r\n + BE\r\n∴ 線圖的斜率 = μ 0I\r\n2π\r\n(80 – 36) × 10–6\r\n50 – 0 = μ 0(5)\r\n2π\r\n μ 0 = 1.11 × 10–6 T m A–1\r\n複習 5 Q4 (p.213)\r\nr\r\n長直導線 A\r\n手機\r\n圖 a\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-405-9":{"id":"ex-405-9","chapter":"405","number":9,"title":"長螺線管內的磁場","question":"<p>某個長螺線管有 200 匝，長 25 cm，有 2 A 的電流通過。</p><p>取 μ<sub>0</sub> = 4π × 10<sup>–7</sup> T m A<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 在螺線管內接近中心點處，磁場的強度是多少？</p><p>(b) 解釋以下改變怎樣影響 (a) 的答案。</p><p>(i) 螺線管的長度和匝數都增加至原來的兩倍</p><p>(ii) 螺線管的截面積減小一半</p><p>(iii) 通過螺線管的電流增加至原來的兩倍。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{μ_{0}NI}{l}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(4π \\times  10^{-7}) \\times  200 \\times  2}{0.25}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 2.01 × 10<sup>–3</sup> T</p><p>(b) (i) 因為每單位長度的匝數 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 維持不變，所以結果不會改變。</p><p>(ii) 因為長螺線管內的磁場與截面積的大小無關，所以結果不會改變。</p><p>(iii) 由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> ∝ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span>，當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span> 增加至原來的兩倍，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 也會增加至原來的兩倍。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_405_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4c972497783d6279d678f5679a0fc8e8e6673dc5a5d4cb672ee1a57d5f7f7b3a","segments":[{"page":25,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,264.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 9 長螺線管內的磁場\r\n某個長螺線管有 200 匝，長 25 cm，有 2 A 的電流通過。\r\n 取 μ 0 = 4π × 10–7 T m A–1。\r\n(a) 在螺線管內接近中心點處，磁場的強度是多少？\r\n(b) 解釋以下改變怎樣影響 (a) 的答案。\r\n (i) 螺線管的長度和匝數都增加至原來的兩倍\r\n (ii) 螺線管的截面積減小一半\r\n (iii) 通過螺線管的電流增加至原來的兩倍。\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,264.6500701904297,565.2833009033203,486.1869833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) B = μ 0NI\r\nl\r\n = (4π × 10–7) × 200 × 2\r\n0.25\r\n = 2.01 × 10–3 T\r\n(b) (i) 因為每單位長度的匝數 n 維持不變，所以結果不會改變。\r\n (ii) 因為長螺線管內的磁場與截面積的大小無關，所以結果不會\r\n改變。\r\n (iii) 由於 B ∝ I，當 I 增加至原來的兩倍，B 也會增加至原來的兩\r\n倍。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}